3. NO WARRANTY

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.

This disclaimer is not boilerplate for this particular application, and it is
worth being explicit about why. Ciyato manages files, moves photos to the system
trash, deletes duplicates, and encrypts files into a vault whose key the
operating system may invalidate if the device's screen lock is removed. Those are
destructive and irreversible operations performed on the user's own data at the
user's own instruction. The application asks for confirmation before each of
them and states the consequences beforehand (see SECURITY.md), but no software
can undo a deletion the user asked for.

IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR
OTHER LIABILITY, INCLUDING ANY LOSS OF DATA, ARISING FROM OR IN CONNECTION WITH
THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE.

